      <activity id="b7e3bf20-7458-5791-a536-911ddb26b8e1" activityNameId="32dd838c-b0e6-5009-8512-8b9c386f81e1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Stone meal, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Stone meal, at regional storehouse
Values originate from a single producer of stone meal in Switzerland, which, however, can be considered typical for the Swiss market.;
UUID: 0a150445-09b8-3425-b9f1-82cd70c11810
Stone meal is a by-product (filter residue) of stone mining. Energy requirements for further processing required to obtain a commercial stone meal fertiliser were included. In addition, transports from the manufacturer to the regional storehouse were taken into consideration. Infrastructure and land use were included by means of a proxy-module.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Values refer to a commonly used technology for this product.
Time period: Year when data for the inventory were communicated
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data retrieved from a Swiss manufacturer. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a150445-09b8-3425-b9f1-82cd70c11810.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
